                                "sense_id": "32aa6c37-0cdc-376c-b32d-3cd4d2801e72",
                                "text": "I made effort to arouse myself by aid of frequent Lafitte, and, all failing, I betook myself to a stray newspaper in despair. (The Angel of the Odd - Edgar Allan Poe)",
